# Offensive play file.
#   type: run | pass
#   formation: name from formations/offense.yaml (players, personnel, alignment)
#   assign: per player id -> role and parameters. Unassigned players get defaults:
#     run:  QB = handoff, carrier = carry, everyone else = run_block
#     pass: QB = pass, everyone else = pass_block
#   roles: pass_block, run_block, lead (lead blocker through the hole), route, carry, handoff, pass
#   route: name from routes.yaml, or inline {points: [[x, y], ...], sit: true/false}
#   family: plays that look alike to a defense (other slant concepts, other four verticals ...): a defense
#           that has seen one of the family lately reads the others a little faster (config/game.yaml familiarity)
#   ai: hints for the CPU coordinator (depth = typical gain/target depth in yards; multipliers per situation)
name: Inside Zone
