# Names, numbers and depth order are real; the ratings are estimates on the ESPN NFL 2K5 scale (0-99)
# plus discipline (0-99, high = rarely flagged) and catch_in_traffic ... juke (tools/derived_ratings.py).
# run_style: finesse | balanced | power.
