# depth_chart lists jersey numbers per group in depth order. Formations take players from these
# groups (OL = LT, LG, C, RG, RT, backups; DE = the edge rushers, DT = the interior linemen;
# LB = WLB, MLB, SLB, backups; CB = LCB, RCB, nickel; S = SS, FS, backups).
